Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.90,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along\NAll your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\NThat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how much of\Na badass he used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's just a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.10,0:02:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have to break a\Nsweat to kill this old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spare him, but you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't make this any harder, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.02,0:02:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't force me to kill both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look even dumber at gunpoint, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of example do you think\Nyou're setting for All the other cooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need a lecture\Nfrom a brat like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop calling me names?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit treating me like a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.72,0:02:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji wouldn't abandon Zeff, now would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point that gun at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's eager to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, I'd be\Nmore than happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure to beat\Nyou to a bloody lifeless pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely natural, Pearl! Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you dodge that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if I did, that rat over\Nthere would pull the trigger on Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave the restaurant\Npeacefully and no one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This restaurant is that old man's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already taken everything\Nelse that man holds dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So while I'm around,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let anything\Nelse get taken from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.36,0:03:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The All Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's out there somewhere, and all\Nthat's even awesomer than they say it is!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.98,0:04:15.74,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(728,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(686,728,\1a&H00&)}Because of a Dream
