Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for seafaring cooks don't\Nget me wrong we've all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had our little fantasies\Nabout it but you gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.52,0:04:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,remember that it's just\Na dream a dream well I'm
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.66,0:04:31.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Sanji (9 Years Ago)\NPassenger Ship\NCook's Apprentice
Dialogue: 2,0:04:26.66,0:04:31.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\3c&HF9F8FB&\c&HF9F8FB&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Sanji (9 Years Ago)\NPassenger Ship\NCook's Apprentice
Dialogue: 3,0:04:26.66,0:04:31.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,60)\c&HF9F8FB&\4a&HFF&}Sanji (9 Years Ago)\NPassenger Ship\NCook's Apprentice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna find the all-blue\Nthen we'll see who's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dreaming that's quite the\Nquest good luck all right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there little man tell\Nme do you even know what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of place the all-blue\Nis yeah I do I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The all-blue is a place for\Nfish from all four seas, Lou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's fish from East Blue, the West\NBlue, the North Blue, and the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To cooks who have taken to the\Nsea, it's an irresistible paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:04:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place is a gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got fish and plants\Nfrom all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.44,0:05:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any chef would jump at\Nthe chance to cook there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cooks I know would risk\Nlife and limb to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a miracle sea like the\Nall-blue could actually exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's probably just a lie\Ntold by some daydreaming cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.84,0:05:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, enough with the silly stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out there and collect\Nsome plates, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man. What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.46,0:05:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They left behind plates and plates\Nfull of this delicious crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's barely been touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty good stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd love it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, the customers\Nthese days are spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way gross to eat the\Nleftovers of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should just let me\Nthrow that stuff away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of talk proves you've got a\Nwhole lot to learn, so listen up, Shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you choose life on the high\Nseas, you've got to be resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean is a strange\Nand unpredictable place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where wasting food could\Nbe a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you have some, eh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panicking won't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.08,0:06:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.86,0:06:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Redfoot Zap and the Cook Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back from the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}"Red Leg" Zeff\NCook Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\3c&HF9F8FB&\c&HF9F8FB&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}"Red Leg" Zeff\NCook Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:06:38.25,0:06:40.92,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,90)\c&HF9F8FB&\4a&HFF&}"Red Leg" Zeff\NCook Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the infamous\Npirate, Captain Red Leg Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steal everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Addison nails down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:06:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die at the\Nhands of those animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not careful, you might\Njust put someone's eye out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mongrels better stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you'll make them mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bit young to have a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's no reason not to grab it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you jerks, if I'm dying here,\Nthen I'm taking some of you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to live so that\NI can find the all blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said the all blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty ambitious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, should we tell the\Nlittle tyke it doesn't exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't... Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to draw my last\Nbreath until I've seen the old blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, I recommend we\Nwithdraw immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This storm is way bigger than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, men, playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's load up the treasure\Nand get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:09:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he risk his life for one measly kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Brat finally wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to be alive, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving isn't a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still pretty banged\Nup from the beating, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the ships? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a terrible storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our ships were most likely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems we're the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Washed ashore on a desolate rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without so much as a coconut\Ntree to give us food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, there are fish in the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the rock has been\Ncurved by the waves in such
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a manner that we wouldn't\Nbe able to climb back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.56,0:10:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we ever went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.26,0:10:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can whine all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nobody comes, we'll just dry up and\Nbecome two more skeletons in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skeletons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.37,0:10:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bag there, it's your share of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some of the food that washed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should be about five days' worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but it's\Nbetter than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ration it out, it'll last longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.14,0:11:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or use your head when you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing we're both cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that bag your share of the food?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got way more than me, you fat old pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I get more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a grown man, so I need more\Nto survive than a runt like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful that\NI'm sharing any of it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't expect any pity\Nfrom me, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the other side of this\Nrock and watch for ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know as soon as you see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, don't bother talking\Nto me or moving from your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll just waste energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying anything if I see a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.36,0:12:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have five whole days worth of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.92,0:12:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll definitely see a ship\Nor two before I run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to be extra safe, I'll\Ndivide it up for 20 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's more than enough\Ntime to get rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess all I got to do\Nnow is sit and wait. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it through this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't see a ship today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only be a few more days
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One moldy piece of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, what a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They left behind plates and plates\Nfull of this delicious grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way gross to eat the\Nleftovers of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should just let me\Nthrow that stuff away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you have some, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My last piece of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the geyser dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's still got food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to get that food!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that he has so\Nmuch more than me besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all his fault
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here your brat are\Nyou here because you saw a ship I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came over here to\Nsteal your food, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me for it, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, I'll starve. It\Nmakes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:16:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to come\Nover here unless you saw a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.06,0:16:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.26,0:16:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have all this money, and\Nyet we're going to starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.38,0:16:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on here old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to have eaten something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you give me all of the food you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:17:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you had to have known that without\Nthat leg, you'd never be a pirate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense to\Nsacrifice so much for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because, for my entire life,\NI've had the same dream as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be all blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your men said that it doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the old blue is sure to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a pirate are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die now. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.30,0:17:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:18:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many men have lost\Ntheir lives cursing the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowing that it will soon be their grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the first time I've been\Nhungry enough to look death in the eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my thoughts are the same each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is always my deepest wish that there\Nbe a restaurant in the middle of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was thinking that if I\Nmake it out of this mess alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to build a restaurant\Nas my final purpose in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll even help you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't die, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weak little brat like you\Ncouldn't be much good for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll become strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The geezer needs help! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here! Help us! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here! Over here!\NHelp! Help! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old coot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave up his legs so that I could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to repay the old fart for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his kindness unless I\Nrisk my life for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you standing, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.52,0:19:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little too much like giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cue little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so very refined of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this restaurant will be closing soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'll open again for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gino, shoot the old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.64,0:20:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my mind That I knew would Leave me I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had to find my way To that place Before
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone could beat me The promised land
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was in my grasp And I wouldn't let go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chasing it Until it comes true
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,changes I call out your name
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could return to the time\NWhen everything's the same
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you My memories won't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fade Waiting for that one true dream?

